</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12. </span>Trigger time and root cause analysis time shown as CDFs (a-b) and comparisons across different GPU counts (c-d), measured in ByteDance’s production environment.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure class="ltx_table" id="S7.T5">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5. </span>CPU &amp; memory usage in Megatron’s GPT training.</figcaption>
<div class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:433.6pt;height:76.5pt;vertical-align:-36.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(12.8pt,-1.2pt) scale(1.06259087619629,1.06259087619629) ;">
<table class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr class="ltx_tr">
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Metric</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Idle</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">
<table class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr class="ltx_tr">
<td class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Baseline</span></td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mycroft</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">NVRx</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">
<table class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr class="ltx_tr">
<td class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Nsight with</span></td>
</tr>
